# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Mi-Portafolio Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTES:
# 1. NEVER commit actual secrets to version control
# 2. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values
# 3. .env.local is automatically excluded from git (see .gitignore)
# 4. Use NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix ONLY for values that should be exposed to the browser
# 5. NEVER use NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix for service role keys or private API keys
#
# Requirements covered: 7.1-7.7 (Environment Variable Security)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Find these values in your Supabase Dashboard:
# https://app.supabase.com/project/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/settings/api

# PUBLIC: Supabase project URL (safe to expose to browser)
# Used by client-side Supabase client for database operations
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co

# PUBLIC: Supabase anonymous key (safe to expose to browser)
# This key has limited permissions controlled by RLS policies
# Used by client-side Supabase client for authenticated requests
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.your-anon-key

# PRIVATE: Supabase service role key (NEVER expose to browser)
# ⚠️ WARNING: This key BYPASSES Row Level Security policies!
# Only use in server-side API routes (app/api/*)
# DO NOT add NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix to this variable
# Uncomment ONLY if you need server-side admin operations:
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.your-service-role-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Application Configuration (if needed)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Application URL (used for sitemap generation, OG images, etc.)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://your-domain.com

# Contact email (if you want to override the default in code)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=your-email@example.com

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Third-Party Services (add as needed)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Google Analytics (if used)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Email service (e.g., SendGrid, Resend)
# EMAIL_API_KEY=your-email-service-api-key

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DEPLOYMENT INSTRUCTIONS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# For production deployment on Vercel, Netlify, or similar platforms:
#
# 1. Go to your project's environment variables settings
# 2. Add each variable from this file with your actual production values
# 3. Mark sensitive variables (without NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix) as "Secret"
# 4. Verify that SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY is NOT accessible to the client
# 5. Test your deployment to ensure all environment variables are correctly set
#
# Vercel: https://vercel.com/docs/concepts/projects/environment-variables
# Netlify: https://docs.netlify.com/environment-variables/overview/
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════